# Profile 1.1 · every new block in one file
A decision with weighted criteria and evidence, an ASCII diagram, a stream, a playlist, a file list, a repository and an issue snapshot, plus the new global fields `icono`, `pos`, `hash` and `cache`. Open it in Web, Map and Source. :bulb:

