@decision d-diagrams
title: Diagram format for the docs
question: Which format do we use for diagrams in the docs?
options: Mermaid · ASCII · PNG
criterion: Diffable in Git | 3 | 3 | 3 | 0
criterion: Readable without a renderer | 2 | 1 | 3 | 3
criterion: Renders as a real diagram | 2 | 3 | 1 | 3
source: @(a-diff)
source: @(a-offline)
chosen: Mermaid
status: decided
date: 2026-10-19
reopen_if: the offline renderer can no longer draw Mermaid
icon: :scale:
pos: 420,560

Weights were set by a person. An agent computed the score and proposed the choice; the person approved it.
@@

@claim a-diff
text: Mermaid and ASCII are plain text, so a pull request shows the exact change.
certainty: Verified
source: f-git
@@

@claim a-offline
text: Most readers will open the docs with a Mermaid-capable renderer.
certainty: Assumed
@@

